    <mxCell id="c3note" value="body max-height 220px + overflow-y auto (kept). User scrolls freely; auto-follow only at bottom. Sticky state persists: entry.thinkingUser = true AND direction stored (entry.thinkingCollapsed boolean &#8212; today only &#8226;managed&#8226; is stored, rebuild-after-detach always re-expands, chat-cycle.js L117-128)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;fontColor=#999999;fontStyle=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="70" y="746" width="640" height="46" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="cx1frame" value="Root causes (code evidence) &#8594; design responses" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#cccccc;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="780" y="50" width="420" height="750" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="cx1" value="R1. Invisible affordance &#8212; collapsed = bare 12px line, no chevron contrast, no size/duration cue; users misread it as a divider.&#10;&#8594; Header always carries chevron + &#8226;Thinking &#183; N chars &#183; Ts&#8226;; min-height 28px; hover bg (list.hoverBackground)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacing=6;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="796" y="78" width="388" height="96" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="cx2" value="R2. Multi-cycle stacking &#8212; a turn can emit N cycles; each leaves its own 1-line collapsed block, visually merging into one divider. Clicking a near-empty one looks like &#8226;nothing happens&#8226;.&#10;&#8594; Issue-3 trace groups ALL cycles&#39; thinking into one unit; per-cycle blocks keep their own chevrons inside." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacing=6;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="796" y="186" width="388" height="110" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="cx3" value="R3. State loss on rebuild &#8212; ensureThinking() rebuilds a detached block EXPANDED even when the user had collapsed it (thinkingUser stores only &#8226;managed&#8226;, not direction); closeCycle may then re-collapse it &#8212; block appears to &#8226;jump&#8226;.&#10;&#8594; Store direction: entry.thinkingCollapsed; rebuild honors it; auto rules still respect data-user-managed." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacing=6;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="796" y="308" width="388" height="124" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="cx4" value="R4. Empty-body blocks &#8212; whitespace-only thinking persists (hasThinking checks .length, chat-cycle.js L161 &#8212; no trim), so replay renders a block that &#8226;expands to nothing&#8226;.&#10;&#8594; Trim before persist; drop empty blocks on replay." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacing=6;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="796" y="444" width="388" height="100" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="cx5" value="R5. Scroll hijack while live &#8212; every delta forces body scrollTop to bottom; the expanded body is unreadable mid-stream.&#10;&#8594; Follow-only-at-bottom rule (same as transcript Jump-to-latest in Issue 1)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;dashed=1;fontSize=10;align=left;spacing=6;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="796" y="556" width="388" height="96" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="cx6" value="Non-goals: do NOT change the stream protocol shape for thinking (eventType &#8226;thinking&#8226; stays); do NOT move replay logic (chat-messages.js) &#8212; both paths share one builder after the fix. Accessibility: role=button, aria-expanded, Enter/Space toggle, focus-visible ring on header." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#cccccc;fontSize=10;align=left;spacing=6;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="796" y="664" width="388" height="120" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
